{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22095","headline":"感时 · 白居易","name":"感时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝见日上天，暮见日入地。\n不觉明镜中，忽年三十四。\n勿言身未老，冉冉行将至。\n白发虽未生，朱颜已先悴。\n人生讵几何，在世犹如寄。\n虽有七十期，十人无一二。\n今我犹未悟，往往不适意。\n胡爲方寸间，不贮浩然气。\n贫贱非不恶，道在何足避。\n富贵非不爱，时来当自致。\n所以达人心，外物不能累。\n唯当饮美酒，终日陶陶醉。\n斯言胜金玉，佩服无失坠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}